Z||000020||82-T/A||12-14-2000||07:53 AM||||Well, the car that I currently drive as my daily driver is a VERY conservative looking<BR>1997 Pontiac GrandAm SE. <P>It's white, 4 doors, 4 cyl, automatic... it even has hub caps! haha..<P>But don't get me wrong, I love the car. I didn't just buy it and started liking it. I specifically looked for one like that. I needed something reliable, something that got AWESOME gas mileage on the highway (34mpg on the highway), something easy to drive, something that handled better than most other sedans on the road.. and something that had plenty of room for all my crap.<P>The cars perfect. In addition, it runs low 16s in the quarter so it really gets up and goes.<P><BR>Other cars that I HAVE owned at one time are<P>1982 Pontiac TransAm<BR>1984 Toyota Corolla<BR>1988 Mazda RX-7 Turbo-II<BR>1984 Volvo 240 Turbo Wagon<BR>1985 Volvo 240 Turbo 2-Door Bertone<P>and a few other cars.. forgot.<P><P>------------------<BR>Todd Jaspers<BR>1997 Pontiac GrandAm SE<BR>1987 Pontiac Fiero SE/V6<BR>1984 Pontiac Fiero 2m4 SE<BR>http://www.ezshots.com/album.cgi?82tafiero/Apartment||||reg||1
